==English==
===Etymology===
From German ''[[Ansatz]]''.
===Noun===
{{infl|en|noun}}
#a [[mathematical]] [[expression]] assumed to describe a certain phenomenon, but without a proved justification for its use. It often is related to empirically obtained formulae.

